        "signature": "Begins with three hunting tendrils. They strike adjacent Allies for 4 Water (+2 each successive command); otherwise move one orthogonal space toward the weakest Ally, swapping past player cards and Constructs, then strike if adjacent after moving, otherwise Splash that Ally for 1 Water (+0.5 each successive command, rounded up). Replacements start again at 4 strike / 1 Splash. Without Allies they move left and Splash the player from their resulting column, or inflict Poison 2 instead when starting at the left edge. Deaths 1–3 replace one-for-one, 4–6 two-for-one, then three-for-one. Replacements warn the killing card's space (extras nearby), give one full player turn of reprieve, then erupt after survivors act, destroying any card or Construct left there. At the end of each full move cycle, if afflicted by Burn, Poison or Corrode, spends its next move on Purify to clear all three, then resumes its cycle.",
